  speakerModel: {fileID: 487989445}
  autoButton: {fileID: 531939124}
  autoButtonText: {fileID: 970034793}
  autoButtonImage: {fileID: 531939125}
  autoOffSprite: {fileID: 1852599099772028583, guid: 8c511b4a33bb0b8428cff07a4969127f, type: 3}
  autoOnSprite: {fileID: -1307664305451782276, guid: b5a9445a2d8809541a661216e7ec0e8a, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - "Hello, <color=#F87400>{player_name}</color>! you probably wonder why you\u2019re
    here."
  - "You\u2019ve owed me money for traveling here."
  - "Welcome to our <color=#F87400>Floating Island</color>! The place where ya\u2019ll
    work from now on."
  - To pay your debts of course.
  - "Let\u2019s start with basics shall we?"
  - Firstly, this is your <color=#F87400>wallet</color>. It'll tell you how much
    money you have at the moment.
  - "Then there is a <color=#F87400>calendar</color>. It\u2019ll tell you how many
    days have passed since you started working here."
  - This is your profile where you can see your <color=#F87400>ID card</color>.
  - Oh! And communication is very important! you might want to <color=#F87400>remember</color>
    the name of each tool, ingredients and menu.
  - you can view all your <color=#F87400>vocabulary collection</color> here.
  - To start working you simply have to tap on the <color=#F87400>Country Icon</color>.
  - The window will appear and show all the information about this place.
  - Then click the <color=#F87400>start shift</color> right here to begin your start
    <color=#F87400>shift</color>!
  - Sometimes we might want to keep track of our customers in <color=#F87400>customer
    collections</color>. Who knows? They could be our regular in the future.
  - Task
  - Gacha
  - Mail
